{"word":"περίεργος","uri":"periergos","senses":[{"word":"περίεργος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">περί·εργος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος,\nον</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">act.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui prend un soin\nsuperflu, minutieux à l’excès, <span class=\"aut\">Lys.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">123, 24 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">102</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">μάταιος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mem.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 3, 1 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">περίεργόν ἐστι</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec\nl’inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">47</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> il est superflu de, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> qui s’occupe de ce qui\nne le regarde pas, indiscret, <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">D. mar.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 2 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">πολυπράγμων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arr.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Epict.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 1,\n21 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">adv.</span> <span class=\"grec\">περίεργα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">12, 175,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> avec une\ncuriosité indiscrète ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> qui concerne la magie,\n<span class=\"aut\">NT.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Luc.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">19, 19 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\npers.</span> adonné à l’étude de la magie, <span class=\"aut\">DC.</span> <span class=\"refch\">69, 11</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"